  "actor_observability": {
    "current": "RobotRepresentation hardcodes proprio. Actor history 10x77 = projected gravity3, base angular velocity3, joint position24 relative to home, joint velocity24, previous action23. No root XY, no base linear velocity. Goal540 excludes 30 reference-relative-root translation columns.",
    "upstream_default": "BaseRunnerCfg.actor_obs=rep_state and history_length=1; this is an official supported configuration.",
    "rep_state_robot58": "z1, gravity3, body linear velocity3, body angular velocity3, joint q24, joint v24. No XY. Motion Actor goal remains 540 for every mode: make_motion_task uses actor_goal_dim(570)=540 and compute_wm_goal second return.",
    "proven": "Pure global XY translation with unchanged orientation, joints, velocities, history and reference time leaves current Actor input unchanged; rep58+goal540 also remains translation-invariant. World-model/Critic goal570 changes. This is a source-level invariance, not a measured causal explanation of the failures.",
    "unproven": "Whether direct velocity/height in official rep_state improves stopping/arm-base coordination or eventual whole-task success."
  },
  "rep_state_minimal_mapping": [
    "Parameterize actor_obs and history_length rather than hardcoded proprio/10; preserve old checkpoint behavior when cfg omitted.",
    "Return robot rep[:58] through ContactRepresentation.compute_actor_sensor for rep_state, leaving passive door and geometry17 dimensions only in WM/Critic.",
    "Construct Actor obs_dim58/history1, original make_motion_task(rep,570) yielding goal540, same action map/effort units and learners.",
    "No proprio sensor noise in rep_state path, following upstream early return. Collector, imagination and eval must agree.",
    "DoorImagination.sample_initial_states uses single replay initial state with history1; remove mandatory unflatten(10,77) for this mode.",
    "Keep real 200 ms/10-policy-step prefix independent from history_length1; no artificial historical frames required for rep mode.",
    "Update load_policy, free/servo evaluation adapters to read cfg, use current robot58 and original goal540. Strict dimensions and tensor agreement across collection/eval/imagination.",
    "Fresh Actor/Critic/optimizers/replay for separately named config comparison. No claim of inherited optimizer continuity from proprio Actor."
  ],
